// DELIBERATELY BROKEN -- module 2.
// A missing semicolon and a missing closing bracket.  The LALR parser
// reports the error with the set of tokens that WOULD have been legal in
// that state (read straight out of the parse table), then recovers to the
// next ';' so that later errors are still found.

tempo 120
key C major ;
instrument piano = "grand piano" ;
voice tune on piano = [ C4 E4 G4 ;
play tune ;
